+7. `idle.screensaver` and `idle.lock` are seconds since user idle began. Optional `idle.keyboardBacklight` is the same clock; omit it or set `0` to leave the keyboard LED at the last chosen level. Without the key, a platform's default from `/usr/share/omarchy-platform/idle.json` (`{"keyboardBacklight": <seconds>}`) applies; a machine without a `*kbd_backlight*` LED has no timeout.
